Rejected (in part): the issue on image derivatives asked templates to fall back to the original when the source's hash differs. Liquid cannot hash a file at build time, and site.static_files modification times are checkout times on GitHub Pages, so a build cannot detect a screenshot replaced in place. Adopted instead:
- derivatives are content-hashed and looked up by source path in _data/derivatives.yml;
- a new or renamed source falls back to the original;
- contract-main.yml runs make-derivatives.py --check on every push and reports stale entries.
